                            </p>

                            <h4 class="text-transf" id="3">Final Thoughts</h4>
                            <p class="span">Keywords are the engine that powers Google Ads, therefore it's critical that you can keep them up to current with regular checks and updates. It's a constant optimization process that's vital for <a href="https://www.kingofdigitalmarketing.com/blog/what-is-cpc-and-its-role-in-google-ads.aspx">Google Ads</a> performance, from adding new keywords to eliminating non-performing ones to upgrading negative keywords and modifying pricing.</p>

